#====================================================================
# DRAFT-conan2-hmdfs-package-build-colocated - Conan 2.x package/build share a parent dir
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-conan2-hmdfs-package-build-colocated
trigger_tool:           conan
phase:                  cache|build|package
error_signature:        os.utime.*FileNotFoundError|Corrupted package|conaninfo.txt|Already installed

severity:               2
category:               conan|hmdfs|cache|ohos
match_keywords:         os.utime, FileNotFoundError, Corrupted package, conaninfo.txt, Already installed, p/b, package folder, base_folder
title:                  Do not rm -rf conan2 p/b/*; package lives beside build and orphaned sqlite rows corrupt the cache

root_cause:             In Conan 2.x the package folder is p/b/<hash>/p/ and the build folder is p/b/<hash>/b/ — same parent. Deleting p/b/*/ removes the package too, while cache.sqlite3 keeps a row pointing at the deleted base_folder; the next install hits os.utime(base_folder) -> FileNotFoundError.
verification_cmd:       conan list "qtbase/*:*"; a corrupted package prints "without conaninfo.txt in .../p/b/<hash>/p/conaninfo.txt".

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           use-conan-remove
rec_description:         To free space on the device, prefer `conan remove "<name>/<ver>" -c` (removes recipe+binary+sqlite rows) or delete only the build child p/b/<hash>/b/, never the whole p/b/<hash>/.
rec_command:             conan remove "qtbase/6.11.1" -c
rec_auto_fix:            false
rec_impl:                cache-management

forbid_1_pattern:        rm -rf .*conan-home/p/b/\*/
forbid_1_reason:          The wildcard deletes the package folder alongside the build folder.
forbid_1_consequence:    cache.sqlite3 orphaned rows cause os.utime FileNotFoundError on the next create.

doc_file:                knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-conan2-hmdfs-package-build-colocated.md
last_updated:            2026-09-22
source_event:            qtnetworkauth/6.11.1 shadow CI cache cleanup (job qtnetworkauth-6.11.1-shadow-20260921-200037)
draft:                   true
contributor_id:          AtomCode
authors:                 AtomCode (GLM-5.2)
metrics_success_count:    1
metrics_fail_count:       0
metrics_confidence:       0.85
metrics_last_used:        2026-09-22
